{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Your galactic cruise has gone horribly wrong.\u00a0 The ship is hijacked.\u00a0 The princess is kidnapped.\u00a0 You\u2019re shipwrecked on a wild alien world.\u00a0 Now it\u2019s up to you to survive, rescue the princess, and find a way home!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/62c5afb04f2fd0725bd031bb92c80bb0.poster.avif?t=1752699260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/62c5afb04f2fd0725bd031bb92c80bb0.webm?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/62c5afb04f2fd0725bd031bb92c80bb0.mp4?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 On planets smaller than earth, catching fish is easy, just snag fish from the air with your Auto-Hook 5000 fishing pole.\u00a0 Kick your feet up and relax, while your local robo-captain navigates the boat!\u00a0 Multi-catches earn more cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/31dc26af7ada7dabec7896d48a71d272.poster.avif?t=1752699260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/31dc26af7ada7dabec7896d48a71d272.webm?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/31dc26af7ada7dabec7896d48a71d272.mp4?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Blast through raging rapids, collecting gold rings for extra dough!\u00a0 Dodge boulders, jump waterfalls, and rack up riches to earn the next leg of your journey.\u00a0 Every extra dollar brings you closer to home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/d307872c531f0105fbd764c1824faae1.poster.avif?t=1752699260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/d307872c531f0105fbd764c1824faae1.webm?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/extras/d307872c531f0105fbd764c1824faae1.mp4?t=1752699260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Chase alien fish to their secret hideouts!\u00a0 You must outmaneuver them for your next haul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 It\u2019s a wild, fast-paced adventure across an alien world.\u00a0 Can you survive, outsmart the pirates, free the princess, and get yourself back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095300?t=1752699260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095300?t=1752699260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752699260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095300/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752699260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharin